# The compiled SPA in static/ is checked in so a fresh clone can run
# `python -m host.controller_web_editor` without Node.  Rebuild on
# changes via `cd web && npm run build` (the server also rebuilds
# automatically when src/ is newer than static/ and Node is available).
# Recoverable backup written by the hitboxes API on save.
hitboxes/*.bak
# Per-install user preferences (theme, etc.) -- not tracked.
prefs.json
